  "body": "Handling of lines between sections seems random and inconsistent; this is a freestyle clean-up PR that simply limits the number of empty lines to three. (More work, some form of style guide, and ideally some automation would be needed to make this entirely consistent.)\n\nSigned-off-by: Jens Oliver Meiert <jens@meiert.com>\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/f1d1d4a...5bd4c94/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/common-microsyntaxes.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94)\">/common-microsyntaxes.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/f1d1d4a...5bd4c94/common-microsyntaxes.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/edits.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94)\">/edits.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/f1d1d4a...5bd4c94/edits.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94)\">/form-control-infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7109/f1d1d4a...5bd4c94/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 23, 2021, 5:04 PM UTC (5bd4c94